{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 14, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL QUESTIONS ABOUT THE NATURE OF AUTHORITY AND OBEDIENCE. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CRITICAL THINKING AND MORAL AUTONOMY, AS IT SUGGESTS THAT INDIVIDUALS SHOULD NOT BLINDLY FOLLOW LAWS THAT THEY BELIEVE ARE UNJUST OR IMMORAL. HOWEVER, THIS SENTENCE CAN ALSO BE SEEN AS OVERLY SIMPLISTIC, AS IT DOES NOT PROVIDE ANY GUIDANCE ON HOW TO DETERMINE WHETHER A LAW IS \"BAD\" OR NOT.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" CAN BE SEEN AS A RECIPE FOR ANARCHY AND SOCIAL UNREST, AS IT SEEMS TO ENCOURAGE INDIVIDUALS TO TAKE THE LAW INTO THEIR OWN HANDS AND DISREGARD AUTHORITY WHENEVER THEY DISAGREE WITH IT. THIS COULD LEAD TO A BREAKDOWN IN SOCIAL ORDER AND THE RULE OF LAW, AS INDIVIDUALS MAY FEEL JUSTIFIED IN IGNOREING LAWS THAT THEY DO NOT LIKE, RATHER THAN WORKING TO CHANGE THEM THROUGH LEGITIMATE MEANS. THEREFORE, THIS SENTENCE SHOULD BE VIEWED WITH CAUTION, AS IT HAS THE POTENTIAL TO UNDERMINE THE VERY FABRIC OF SOCIETY.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.577531944960356e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -2.3007127310847864e-05}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.0009129646932706237}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.202602356672287}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.001329015358351171}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -9.775113539944869e-06}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " YOU", "lo